@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include ../shortfall/style.iuml
title Nutrition totals and excess warnings: selected relationships
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 65
hide empty members

class Parser
class ViewPlanCommand {
  - dayNumber: Integer [0..1]
  + execute(recipeBook: RecipeBook): String
}
interface "Supplier<List<List<MealSummary>>>" as MealsSource <<interface>> {
  + get(): List<List<MealSummary>>
}
interface "Supplier<NutritionTargets>" as TargetsSource <<interface>> {
  + get(): NutritionTargets
}
class ActiveMealPlan {
  + get(): Optional<MealPlan>
  + getRequest(): Optional<GeneratePlanRequest>
}
class GeneratePlanRequest <<record>> {
  - days: int
}
class NutritionTargets {
  - calories: Integer [0..1]
  - protein: Integer [0..1]
  - carbs: Integer [0..1]
  - fats: Integer [0..1]
  + calculateExcesses(totals: NutritionTotals): NutritionTotals
}
class NutritionTotals <<record>> {
  - calories: long
  - protein: long
  - carbs: long
  - fats: long
}
class MealPlanViewer {
  + view(mealsByDay: List<List<MealSummary>>, targets: NutritionTargets): String
  + view(mealsByDay: List<List<MealSummary>>, dayNumber: int, targets: NutritionTargets): String
}
class "MealPlanViewer.MealSummary" as MealSummary <<record>>
class DayPlan {
  + calculateDailyNutritionTotals(): NutritionTotals
}
class Recipe

Parser ..> ViewPlanCommand : creates with suppliers
ViewPlanCommand --> "1" MealsSource : -mealPlanSource
ViewPlanCommand --> "1" TargetsSource : -targetsSource
MealsSource ..> ActiveMealPlan : default lambda reads get()
TargetsSource ..> ActiveMealPlan : default lambda reads getRequest()
ActiveMealPlan --> "0..1" GeneratePlanRequest : -request
GeneratePlanRequest --> "1" NutritionTargets : -targets
ViewPlanCommand ..> MealPlanViewer : creates and calls
MealPlanViewer ..> MealSummary : reads transient display input
MealPlanViewer ..> NutritionTotals : creates daily totals
MealPlanViewer ..> NutritionTargets : calls calculateExcesses
NutritionTargets ..> NutritionTotals : reads totals and creates excesses
DayPlan --> "0..*" Recipe : -meals\n{ordered, nonunique}
DayPlan ..> NutritionTotals : creates combined result

legend bottom
  The supplier interfaces are two bindings of java.util.function.Supplier, not new Java interfaces.
  Default parser lambdas capture shared active-plan state; caller-supplied sources can behave differently.
  MealPlanViewer calculates totals from MealSummary input; it does not call DayPlan's combined-totals API.
  Optional targets are null when omitted. request is an Optional; its contained request is modeled here.
  Records are immutable values. Selected methods are abbreviated; unrelated references and most getters are omitted.
endlegend
@enduml
